# Trivy ignore list - accepted risks for the Session 17 image.
#
# Rules for adding an entry here:
#   1. One CVE per line, with a comment above it saying WHY it is accepted,
#      WHO accepted it, and WHEN it must be re-reviewed.
#   2. Only for findings that do not affect this app or have no fix yet.
#   3. Never add something just to make the gate go green.
#
# Currently empty: the gate only blocks on HIGH/CRITICAL with a fix available,
# and the image (python:3.12-slim + pinned deps) has none of those as of
# 2026-10-07. The remaining LOW/MEDIUM/unfixed Debian findings are visible in
# outputs/07-image-scan-trivy.txt and are tracked, not ignored.
#
# Example format:
# # CVE-YYYY-NNNNN - glibc, only reachable via <feature> which the app never calls.
# # Accepted by Ridaa Mirza 2026-10-07, review by 2026-11-07.
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
